        "text": "Analyze this security camera image.\n\nDetermine whether there is a PERSON or any UNUSUAL ACTIVITY.\n\nReturn your response in exactly this format:\n\nALERT: YES\nDESCRIPTION: <brief description>\n\nor\n\nALERT: NO\nDESCRIPTION: <brief description>\n\nConsider these as ALERT:\n- A person is visible.\n- Someone appears to be approaching or entering the property.\n- A person is near a vehicle or door.\n- A person is behaving unusually.\n- A suspicious activity is visible.\n- Any other activity that would reasonably warrant a security notification.\n\nNormal empty street scenes, normal lighting changes, trees, shadows, and ordinary background activity should be ALERT: NO.\n\nReturn plain text only. Do not use Markdown.",
